       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TF-MULTIMODAL-DIT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DIT-MULTIMODAL-PROOFS.
           05  WS-PAGED-ATTN-KV-CACHE-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DIT-PATCH-TRANSFORMER-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ROPE-2D-SPATIAL-GRID-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ADALN-ZERO-CONDITION-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LATENT-IMAGE-TEXT-ALIGN  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DIT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-DIT-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-DIT-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PAGED-ATTN-AND-DIT.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ROPE-AND-ADALN.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-MULTIMODAL-ALIGN.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-DIT-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PAGED-ATTN-AND-DIT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PAGED-ATTN-KV-CACHE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIT-PATCH-TRANSFORMER-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ROPE-AND-ADALN.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ROPE-2D-SPATIAL-GRID-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ADALN-ZERO-CONDITION-OK.
       3000-EVALUATE-MULTIMODAL-ALIGN.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LATENT-IMAGE-TEXT-ALIGN.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-DIT-PROOFS.
           IF WS-PAGED-ATTN-KV-CACHE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DIT-PATCH-TRANSFORMER-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ROPE-2D-SPATIAL-GRID-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ADALN-ZERO-CONDITION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LATENT-IMAGE-TEXT-ALIGN = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-DIT-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-DIT-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-DIT-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-DIT-CODE.
